Eduyot 7:9:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rambam_on_Mishnah_Eduyot_7.9.1"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"},{"reference":"Seder HaDorot 1631:1","target":{"entry":1631,"paragraph":1},"witness":"Pinned Warsaw digital witness"},{"reference":"Seder HaDorot 2482:1","target":{"entry":2482,"paragraph":1},"witness":"Pinned Warsaw digital witness"},{"reference":"Mishnah Eduyot 7:8","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Mishnah_Eduyot_7.8"},"witness":"Torat Emet 357"},{"reference":"Gilgulei Neshamot, Alef §9","target":{"url":"https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/גלגולי_נשמות_אות_א"},"witness":"Wikisource digital Hebrew transcription"}]}],"entryEvidence":[]}
